WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Mr. Pei Mu, just give the cat useless medicine.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,800
As for you, I have a big task for you

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,000
Can you guarantee completion?

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,290
YES!

5
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:10,980
Very good, come with me to the kitchen to wrap the garlic

6
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:13,480
Brother, shouldn’t your new vision be used on your business website?

7
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:18,200
Why is it all used on me?

8
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,200
Brother, do you want to be so vicious?

9
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:24,200
You and Youyou eat and let me watch, my life is also my life

10
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:29,840
Me?

11
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:32,840
Is this younger brother of mine mentally retarded?

12
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:36,130
Brother said, this is your favorite tomato and egg noodles

13
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:40,130
I never expected that my eldest brother, who is busy with everything, would actually remember my taste.

14
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:42,130
You've got it, you want me to feed you

15
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:46,130
Only now do I realize that I have been living a decadent life since the car accident.

16
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:48,130
My elder brother silently handled all kinds of things for me.

17
00:00:48,130 --> 00:00:50,348
Big brother's love

18
00:00:50,348 --> 00:00:57,000
Like a mountain, silent but great brother

19
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
My brother is not only mentally retarded, but he should also pick it up
